{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53603","headline":"招李夫人魂赋附楚词 二 · 谢观","name":"招李夫人魂赋附楚词 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩云裾兮流霞袂，倏而来兮忽而逝。\n魂兮勿复游四裔，[盍]归来兮膺万岁。\n（见《文苑英华》卷九六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}